==== (7) THE REGISTER GATE'S CLASS RULES (its own code) ====
     20: THE DISPOSITIONS (register_dispositions.yaml — counts / receipts / footers / registers, each {class, why}): a declared class that differs
     44: GREEN = {'counts': {'ROW', 'LEDGER', 'MEASURE-ONLY'}, 'receipts': {'CLOSE'}, 'footers': {'DAEMONS'}, 'registers': {'ROWS'}}
    190: def contains(text, k): return any(b == k[0] and c == k[1] and v1 <= k[2] <= v2 for b, c, v1, v2 in spans(text))
    205: cls = 'ROW' if row else ('LEDGER' if led else ('ELSEWHERE' if elsewhere else 'NONE'))
